    "bulkers": "The charter market experienced a period of notable volatility this week, hitting a four-week \nlow mid-week before staging a strong rebound at the end of the week. Despite the freight rates' short-\nterm decline, the secondhand asset market continues to remain strong, as we recorded another busy \nweek with 12 transactions, comprising 3 \"baby\" capes, 1 Panamax, 1 Ultramax, 6 Supramaxes & 1 \nHandysize bulk carriers.  \n \nFor a detailed review and additional information regarding these week's transactions, kindly refer to \nour \"representative sales\" section.",
